<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Mindful – Entwicklungsplan</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.svg" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=<%= Date.now() %>" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css"
    />
    <style>
      .plan-page {
        padding: 40px 48px;
        max-width: 1100px;
      }
      .plan-page h1 { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0; }
      .plan-subtitle { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 4px 0 32px; }

      .plan-summary {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }
      .plan-stat {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .plan-stat strong { display: block; font-size: 1.6rem; }
      .plan-stat span { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }

      .plan-team {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }
      .plan-member {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .plan-member .avatar {
        width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #fff; flex-shrink: 0;
      }
      .plan-member .info strong { display: block; font-size: 0.85rem; }
      .plan-member .info small { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }

      .plan-phase { margin-bottom: 28px; }
      .plan-phase h2 {
        font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 12px;
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      }
      .plan-phase h2 .badge {
        font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 10px;
        border-radius: 20px; text-transform: uppercase;
      }
      .badge-done { background: #10b981; color: #fff; }
      .badge-next { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
      .badge-pending { background: var(--surface-2); color: var(--text-secondary); }

      .plan-task {
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-left: 4px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr 140px;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: start;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        transition: border-color 0.15s;
      }
      .plan-task.done { border-left-color: #10b981; }
      .plan-task.next { border-left-color: var(--accent); }

      .plan-task .person { font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--text); }
      .plan-task .person small { display: block; font-weight: 400; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }

      .plan-task .details .file { font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace); font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 4px; }
      .plan-task .details .desc { color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.4; }
      .plan-task .details .commit-msg {
        margin-top: 6px;
        font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        background: var(--surface-2);
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
      }
      .plan-task .status { text-align: right; font-size: 0.75rem; }
      .plan-task .status .tag {
        display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
        font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.65rem;
      }
      .tag-erledigt { background: #10b981; color: #fff; }
      .tag-offen { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
      .tag-wip { background: #f59e0b; color: #fff; }

      .plan-footer {
        margin-top: 40px;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        background: var(--surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="app-layout">
      <%- include('partials/sidebar') %>

      <main class="plan-page">
        <header style="margin-bottom:8px">
          <div class="eyebrow">Entwicklungsprozess</div>
          <h1>Projektplan</h1>
          <p class="plan-subtitle">
            Übersicht aller Aufgaben, Verantwortlichkeiten und Commit-Nachrichten
            für das Mindful-Projekt – dokumentiert für den Uni GitLab-Workflow.
          </p>
        </header>

        <!-- Statistics -->
        <div class="plan-summary">
          <div class="plan-stat"><strong data-total="14">14</strong><span>Tasks gesamt</span></div>
          <div class="plan-stat"><strong data-done="12">12</strong><span>erledigt</span></div>
          <div class="plan-stat"><strong data-next="2">2</strong><span>als nächstes</span></div>
          <div class="plan-stat"><strong>5</strong><span>Teammitglieder</span></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Team -->
        <div class="plan-team" id="planTeam">
          <div class="plan-member">
            <div class="avatar" style="background:#4c91ff">SA</div>
            <div class="info"><strong>Sascha</strong><small>Backend · Daten</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-member">
            <div class="avatar" style="background:#10b981">JA</div>
            <div class="info"><strong>Jaro</strong><small>Backend</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-member">
            <div class="avatar" style="background:#f59e0b">OM</div>
            <div class="info"><strong>Omar</strong><small>Frontend</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-member">
            <div class="avatar" style="background:#cf79ff">AI</div>
            <div class="info"><strong>Aisha</strong><small>Frontend</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-member">
            <div class="avatar" style="background:#f97316">MO</div>
            <div class="info"><strong>Mo</strong><small>UI/UX</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-member">
            <div class="avatar" style="background:#8B5CF6">YA</div>
            <div class="info"><strong>Yaman</strong><small>UI/UX</small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="plan-member">
            <div class="avatar" style="background:#ef4444">IL</div>
            <div class="info"><strong>Ilhan</strong><small>Dateninfrastruktur</small></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 1: Dateninfrastruktur -->
        <div class="plan-phase">
          <h2>Phase 1 – Dateninfrastruktur <span class="badge badge-done">erledigt</span></h2>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Ilhan, Sascha<small>Dateninfra / Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/database/db.js</div>
              <div class="desc"><code>messages</code>-Tabelle anlegen: Spalten <code>id</code>, <code>from_user_id</code>, <code>to_user_id</code>, <code>subject</code>, <code>body</code>, <code>read</code>, <code>created_at</code>. Migration am Ende der Datei einfügen.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add messages table schema with read flag and timestamps"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Ilhan, Sascha<small>Dateninfra / Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/database/db.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Prüfen, ob alle Tabellen (<code>notes</code>, <code>todos</code>, <code>pomodoro_sessions</code>, <code>tracked_time</code>, <code>messages</code>) vorhanden sind und ggf. automatisch erstellt werden.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "ensure all tables auto-create on startup"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 2: Backend API -->
        <div class="plan-phase">
          <h2>Phase 2 – Backend API <span class="badge badge-done">erledigt</span></h2>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/leaderboard.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue Datei: <code>GET /api/leaderboard</code>. Zählt pro Benutzer: erledigte Todos (heute), Pomodoro-Sitzungen (heute), getrackte Zeit (heute). Gibt sortiertes Array zurück mit <code>user_id</code>, <code>name</code>, <code>initial</code>, <code>value</code>.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add leaderboard api returning top users per category"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/users.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue Datei: <code>GET /api/users</code> (alle Nutzer) und <code>GET /api/users/:id</code> (Profil + Stats: Todos, Pomodoro, Zeit). Gehört zur Community-Funktion.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add user list and profile api for community features"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/messages.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue Datei: Endpunkte für Nachrichten – <code>POST /api/messages/send</code>, <code>GET /api/messages/inbox</code>, <code>GET /api/messages/sent</code>, <code>PUT /api/messages/:id/read</code>, <code>GET /api/messages/unread-count</code>.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add messaging api with send inbox sent read endpoints"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/index.js</div>
              <div class="desc">View-Routen hinzufügen: <code>/leaderboard</code>, <code>/rangliste</code>, <code>/user/:id</code>, <code>/messages</code>, <code>/nachrichten</code>, <code>/profile</code>, <code>/entwicklungsplan</code>. Alle mit <code>auth</code>-Middleware geschützt.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add view routes for leaderboard user messages profile and plan pages"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/app.js / backend/routes/api.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue Router (<code>leaderboard.js</code>, <code>users.js</code>, <code>messages.js</code>) in der Haupt-App einbinden mit <code>app.use('/api', ...)</code>.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "wire up leaderboard users and messages api routers"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 3: Frontend – Community -->
        <div class="plan-phase">
          <h2>Phase 3 – Frontend Community <span class="badge badge-done">erledigt</span></h2>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Omar, Aisha<small>Frontend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/views/leaderboard.ejs</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue Seite: Rangliste mit Tab-Navigation (Aufgaben / Pomodoro / Zeiterfassung), Tabelle mit Platz #, Name, Wert. Angeordnet im <code>.app-layout</code> mit Sidebar.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "create leaderboard page with category tabs and ranking table"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Omar, Aisha<small>Frontend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/public/js/leaderboard.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Lädt Daten von <code>/api/leaderboard?type=todosDone|pomodoro|tracked</code>. Rendert Tabelle mit Gold/Silber/Bronze-Medaille für Platz 1–3. Zeigt leeren Zustand falls keine Daten.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add leaderboard frontend logic with tab switching and medal styling"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Omar, Aisha<small>Frontend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/views/user_profile.ejs</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue Seite: Öffentliches Profil eines Users. Zeigt Avatar, Name, Stati (Todos/Pomodoro/Zeit). "Nachricht senden"-Button.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "create public user profile page with stats and message button"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Omar, Aisha<small>Frontend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/public/js/user_profile.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Lädt Profil von <code>/api/users/:id</code>, befüllt die Seite. "Nachricht senden" leitet zur Messages-Seite mit vorgewähltem Empfänger.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add user profile frontend with data loading and send message action"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Omar, Aisha<small>Frontend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/views/messages.ejs</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue Seite: Posteingang/Gesendet-Tabs, Nachrichtenliste mit Absender/Betreff/Datum, Detailansicht beim Klick. Compose-Modal mit User-Suche.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "create messages page with inbox sent tabs and compose modal"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Omar, Aisha<small>Frontend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/public/js/messages.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Lädt Inbox/Sent von API, rendert Liste + Detail. Compose: User-Suche auf Client-Seite, Send-Request, Abbrechen-Button. Ungelesene-Anzeige.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add messages frontend with inbox sent compose and user search"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 4: UI/UX Styling -->
        <div class="plan-phase">
          <h2>Phase 4 – UI/UX Design & Styling <span class="badge badge-done">erledigt</span></h2>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Mo, Yaman<small>UI/UX</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/public/css/style.css</div>
              <div class="desc">Styles für Leaderboard (Tabs, Tabelle, Medaillen, Hover). Styles für User-Profil. Styles für Messages (Tabs, Liste, Compose-Modal, Formular). Styles für Entwicklungsplan-Seite.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "style leaderboard profile messages and plan page"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Mo, Yaman<small>UI/UX</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/views/partials/sidebar.ejs</div>
              <div class="desc">Links für Rangliste und Nachrichten in der Navigation hinzufügen. Optional: Entwicklungsplan-Link nur für Entwickler sichtbar.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add rangliste and nachrichten links to sidebar"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Mo, Yaman<small>UI/UX</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">frontend/views/notes.ejs + notes.css</div>
              <div class="desc">"Neue Notiz"-Button im Editor-Header. Live Preview (Toggle). Toolbar deaktivieren wenn keine Notiz offen. Leeren Zustand einblenden.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "add new note button live preview and empty state to notes page"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 5: Backend Bugfixes -->
        <div class="plan-phase">
          <h2>Phase 5 – Backend Bugfixes <span class="badge badge-done">erledigt</span></h2>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/kalender.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Fix: Dynamischer SET-Build bei PUT, sodass nur übergebene Felder aktualisiert werden. Ersetzt hartcodierte Spaltenliste.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "fix calendar put to dynamically build SET clause for partial updates"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/todos.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Fix: <code>workspace_id</code> leeren String auf <code>null</code> setzen. <code>faellig</code>-Feld zurücksetzen wenn Datum gelöscht wird. <code>erledigt</code> automatisch auf Unix-Timestamp setzen bei Status "erledigt". Quote-Escaping.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "fix todos: workspace null, faellig clear, erledigt auto-timestamp, quote escaping"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/notizen.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Fix: Bei POST/PUT die Note mit <code>LEFT JOIN workspace</code> zurückgeben, damit das Frontend die workspace-Id und -Farbe sofort hat.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "fix notes post/put to return workspace join data"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task done">
            <div class="person">Jaro, Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">backend/routes/search.js</div>
              <div class="desc">Fix: Such-Query verwendet <code>erstellt</code>-Spalte statt fehlendem <code>aktualisiert</code>. 8 Recent-Results. AbortController. Spotlight-Design im Frontend.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "fix search: correct column name, 8 recents, abort controller, spotlight design"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-erledigt">erledigt</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase 6: Projekt-Setup & Dokumentation -->
        <div class="plan-phase">
          <h2>Phase 6 – Projekt-Setup & Dokumentation <span class="badge badge-next">als nächstes</span></h2>

          <div class="plan-task next">
            <div class="person">Jaro<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">Neues Verzeichnis</div>
              <div class="desc">Neues Projektverzeichnis auf dem Server anlegen: <code>/home/ubuntu/mindful_uni</code>. Code aus <code>mindful_github</code> ohne <code>.git</code>-Verzeichnis kopieren. Neues Git-Repo initialisieren: <code>git init && git add -A && git commit -m "initial commit: mindful dashboard base project"</code>.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git commit -m "initial commit: mindful dashboard base project"</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-wip">in Arbeit</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task next">
            <div class="person">Jaro<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">Remote GitLab</div>
              <div class="desc">Remote auf den Uni GitLab einrichten: <code>git remote add origin git@gitlab.uni-...:gruppe/mindful.git</code>. Push: <code>git push -u origin master</code>.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git push -u origin master</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-offen">offen</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task next">
            <div class="person">Sascha<small>Backend</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">Server-Deployment</div>
              <div class="desc">Neue PM2-Prozess für <code>mindful_uni</code>: <code>pm2 start backend/app.js --name mindful-uni</code>. Port ggf. anpassen (3001).</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">pm2 start backend/app.js --name mindful-uni</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-offen">offen</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="plan-task next">
            <div class="person">Ilhan<small>Dateninfrastruktur</small></div>
            <div class="details">
              <div class="file">GitLab-Workflow-Doku</div>
              <div class="desc">Sicherstellen, dass jede Phase mit sinnvollen Commit-Nachrichten (s.o.) auf dem Uni GitLab sichtbar ist. Nach jeder Phase taggen: <code>git tag phase-1-dateninfra</code>, <code>git tag phase-2-backend-api</code> usw.</div>
              <div class="commit-msg">git tag phase-1-dateninfra</div>
            </div>
            <div class="status"><span class="tag tag-offen">offen</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="plan-footer">
          <strong>Arbeitsweise:</strong> Jedes Teammitglied arbeitet in seinem Bereich und committed mit den vorgegebenen Commit-Nachrichten. Nach jedem Commit wird <code>git push</code> ausgeführt. Der Projektplan wird auf dem Oracle VPS unter <code>/entwicklungsplan</code> live angezeigt und nach jedem Schritt aktualisiert. So entsteht ein nachvollziehbarer Entwicklungsprozess für den Professor.
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script src="/js/app.js?v=<%= Date.now() %>"></script>
  </body>
</html>
